# Festag — dark-mode CTAs

Dark mode: **no colored button fills**. Soft cool-white primary, quiet secondary.

## Geometry

```css
border-radius: 999px;
```

## Idle / secondary (dark)

Google, Apple, SSO, ghost — quiet transparent + hairline:

```css
background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
color: #C4C8D4;
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
```

## Ready / primary (dark)

```css
background: #F0F2F5;
color: #1A1A1E;
border: 1px solid transparent;
box-shadow: none;
```

Hover `#DCE1E8` / active `#CFD5DD`.

## Accent (not CTA fills)

`#5B647D` stays for focus strokes, carets, links — never as dark button fills.

## Light mode

White Linear CTAs (`festag-light-mode-ctas`). Light Google may keep slate `#5B647D`. Execution light Anmelden may stay success green.

## Do not

- Green / slate / blue filled CTAs in dark
- White fill with white text
- Neon blues
- Force `--ready` on empty fields
